{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l1nxysc9","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 2 Offline","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"physics","chapter":"alternating-current","chapterGroup":"electricity","topic":"ac-generator-and-transformer","type":"mcq","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pin-the-method-using-the-transformers-assume-that-the-rat-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-vmajo7oryjs1owo6","content":"<p>In the method using the transformers, assume that the ratio of the number of turns in the primary to that in the secondary in the step-up transformer is 1 : 10. If the power of the consumers has to be supplied at 200 V, the ratio of the number of turns in the primary to that in the secondary in the step-down transformer is</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"200 : 1"},{"identifier":"B","content":"150 : 1"},{"identifier":"C","content":"100 : 1"},{"identifier":"D","content":"50 : 1"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>To solve this problem, we need to understand the working principle of step-up and step-down transformers and the relationships between the voltages and the number of turns of the windings. The key formula we use is the transformer equation:</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.629ex\" height=\"3.353ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1026 3814 1482.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,543.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(228.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"922.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1440.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2496,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,543.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(228.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1078\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n\n<p>where:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.311ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1021.7 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the primary voltage</li>\n  <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.257ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 997.6 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the secondary voltage</li>\n  <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.809ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1241.7 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the number of turns in the primary winding</li>\n  <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.755ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1217.6 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the number of turns in the secondary winding</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Let's break down the problem:</p>\n\n<p>1. The power plant produces an electric power of 600 kW at 4000 V.\n2. A step-up transformer is used at the plant side with a turns ratio of 1 : 10, i.e., <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.747ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 6960 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1519.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2075.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3570.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4626.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5404.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5960,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n\n<p>This tells us that:</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.242ex\" height=\"3.353ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1026 3643.1 1482.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,543.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(228.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"922.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1440.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2496,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(396.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><rect width=\"907.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nSince the primary voltage <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.311ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1021.7 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is 4000 V, we can find the secondary voltage <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.257ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 997.6 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> as follows:\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.614ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 5575.3 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1275.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2331.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3553.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4553.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.827ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 6553.6 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1275.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2331.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3553.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4553.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.93ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 4831.2 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1275.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2331.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(2000,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> V\n</p>\n\n<p>So, at the output of the step-up transformer, the voltage is 40000 V. This high voltage is then transported over the cables to the consumers' location 20 km away. At the consumers' end, a step-down transformer is used to reduce the voltage to 200 V to supply power to the consumers.</p>\n\n<p>Now, we are given that the power supplied at the consumers' end must be 200 V. We need to find the ratio of the number of turns in the primary to the number of turns in the secondary for the step-down transformer so that it outputs 200 V from an input of 40000 V.</p>\n\n<p>Using the transformer equation again, we can write:</p>\n\n<p>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.629ex\" height=\"3.353ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1026 3814 1482.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,543.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(228.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"922.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1440.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2496,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,543.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(228.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1078\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n\n<p>where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.985ex\" height=\"2.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 4855.2 970.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1299.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2355.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(2000,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> V and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.668ex\" height=\"1.901ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3831.2 840.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml